  NpcName: Romeo
  dayGreeting: Which flowers should I pick for tonight?
  dayFarewell: "Her favorites are lilies, but I don\u2019t want to give her the same
    ones every time."
  nightText: "I\u2019m on my way to see my girlfriend. Our parents don\u2019t get
    along, so we meet in secret."
  partyText: "I\u2019ll ask her to dance during the next song... I\u2019ve been saying
    that for three songs now. I\u2019m nervous."
